{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>הילדים רכים.</b> For the eldest among them is twelve years old and a few days." "<b>עלות.</b> Like עלות ינהל (Isaiah 40:11). Now these are the nursing [young] that the goats have mounted, therefore they are called עלות." "And the sense of עלי [is] upon me, upon me to guard them lest they come to harm." "<b>ודפקום.</b> And if the drivers urge them too hard, then all the flock will die."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:46:54.422979634Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}